[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0010","text":"在海之家帮忙，好辛苦呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0020","text":"要动脑子\n而且算是体力活"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0030","text":"确实有点辛苦～\n "},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0040","text":"但雏菜觉得挺开心的～！\n一边想各种事情一边工作，感觉也挺有意思的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0050","text":"是这样啊……好、好厉害"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0060","text":"啊，来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0070","text":"欢迎光临～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0080","text":"欢、欢迎光临……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0090","text":"四位客人对吧\n请到那边的座位就坐"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32300400_03_0100","text":"我、我去拿凉水来……！"}]
